{"ticker":"SARDAEN","symbol":"SARDAEN","instrumentId":3028951,"name":"Sarda Energy & Miner","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Sarda Energy & Minerals Ltd. (SEML) is an integrated steel and power company engaged in the production of steel, ferro alloys, and power generation. The company operates iron ore mines, coal mines, and captive power plants, ensuring a stable supply of raw materials and energy for its operations. SEML’s product portfolio includes sponge iron, billets, ferro alloys, and wire rods, catering to domestic and international markets. With a focus on sustainable mining and efficient manufacturing, the company emphasizes environmental management and resource optimization. Sarda Energy & Minerals plays a key role in India’s industrial growth, delivering quality products with a commitment to sustainability.","website":"www.seml.co.in","location":"Nagpur, INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:55:55.237Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":476.1,"changePct":4.4422507403751235,"week52High":612.7,"week52Low":429.15},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹16,777 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹5,590 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"95,142,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"143"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"24,969,204"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.42%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"2.28"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1.6"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"29.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.01"},{"label":"Beta","value":"0.87"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"10%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"15.09"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"4–28"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"15.0%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"49.23"},{"label":"Volume","value":"203,464"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"390,249"},{"label":"Master score","value":"46"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"67"},{"label":"Price strength","value":"45"},{"label":"Group rank","value":"83"},{"label":"Ac